    + set_availability()
    .. get_candidate is deliberately ..
    .. narrower than the provider's own ..
    .. profile: no coordinates and no ..
    .. profile id. The route exists at all ..
    .. because service_providers_read is ..
    .. auth.uid() is not null, so Postgres ..
    .. would give the row to any caller ..
